  "protocol": "modbus_tcp",
  "tcp_port": 502,
  "byte_order": "word_swapped",
  "notes": "Schneider ION 8650 power quality meter. Default Modbus Slave module map (4-wire WYE). Module 1 (40011-40025): UINT16, scale /10. Module 2 (40027-40057): INT32, scale /10. Module 4 (40091-40119): INT32-M10K, scale /10 — energy and THD max. Wire address = 4X register - 40001. Configurable via ION Setup. Source: 70022-0124-01 (2011).",
  "address_note": "Wire address = Modbus register - 40001. E.g., 40011 → wire address 10. The runtime uses 0-based addressing.",
